  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "您知道阔星的警卫宝可梦\n出问题了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A877E590539614661F76848B66536B5B9D53EF68A6000A51FA95EE98984E865417FF1F00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么问题？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E4895EE9898FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咚咚鼠有问题？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549A549A9F20670995EE9898FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咚咚鼠在对战中输了这件事\n现在成了问题……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549A549A9F2057285BF962184E2D8F934E868FD94EF64E8B000A73B0572862104E8695EE98982026202600100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然这并不是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>您的责任。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F5371368FD95E764E0D662F001000020100000060A876848D234EFB300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "现在有一些人，他们不去确认\n咚咚鼠为什么会输、输给了谁，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而是一味地大肆宣扬输掉的事实……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73B0572867094E004E9B4EBAFF0C4ED64EEC4E0D53BB786E8BA4000A549A549A9F204E3A4EC04E484F1A8F9330018F937ED94E868C01FF0C00100001BE00000A800C662F4E0054735730592780865BA3626C8F93638976844E8B5B9E2026202600100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是为了解决这个问题，\n我们进行了诸多讨论，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n最后得出了起用莫鲁贝可的结论。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F4E3A4E8689E351B38FD94E2A95EE9898FF0C000A62114EEC8FDB884C4E868BF8591A8BA88BBAFF0C00100001BE00000A6700540E5F9751FA4E868D77752883AB9C818D1D53EF76847ED38BBA300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了检验莫鲁贝可能否胜任警卫一职，\n请和它们打一场对战吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8668C09A8C83AB9C818D1D53EF80FD542680DC4EFB8B66536B4E00804CFF0C000A8BF7548C5B834EEC62534E00573A5BF962185427300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等您准备好以后，\n请来和我说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4960A851C65907597D4EE5540EFF0C000A8BF76765548C62118BF44E0058F05427300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您愿意和警卫莫鲁贝可对战吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A8613F610F548C8B66536B83AB9C818D1D53EF5BF962185417FF1F00100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "愿意！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "613F610FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好的，\n随时恭候您再来。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D7684FF0C000A968F65F6606D501960A8518D6765300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢您。\n那么我们就去附近的对战场吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C2260A83002000A90A34E4862114EEC5C3153BB96448FD176845BF96218573A5427300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么就请多指教了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E485C318BF7591A630765594E86300200100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哼！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54FCFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5567FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A554AFF0100100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊啊！对战后肚子饿了的莫鲁贝可\n心情烦躁，开始变得粗暴了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A554AFF015BF96218540E809A5B50997F4E86768483AB9C818D1D53EF000A5FC360C570E68E81FF0C5F0059CB53D85F977C9766B44E86FF0100100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "冲它们这种脾气，也万万不能\n把看守阔星门户的任务交给它们！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B25B834EEC8FD979CD813E6C14FF0C4E5F4E074E074E0D80FD000A628A770B5B889614661F95E8623776844EFB52A14EA47ED95B834EECFF0100100002011401EA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我决定还是和往常一样，把警卫工作\n交给强大又可爱的咚咚鼠。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǪ",
